  <bpmn:task id="Bridge_2_d184" name="Here's the transition sentence connecting Process A and Process B:&#10;&#10;&gt; After finishing their meal at the restaurant, the guest returns to their hotel room. Later, when feeling hungry again, they decide to use the hotel's room service, initiating a call to place an order.&#10;&#10;**Designed Hotel Room Service Process:**&#10;&#10;1.  **Guest:** Calls room service when hungry.&#10;2.  **Room-Service Manager:** Takes down the food and drink order from the guest.&#10;3.  **Room-Service Manager:** Submits the food order ticket to the **Kitchen**.&#10;4.  **Room-Service Manager:** *Decision Point: Does the order include alcohol?* (Yes: 80% likelihood)&#10;    *   *If Yes:* Gives an order to the **Sommelier** to fetch wine/alcohol and prepare alcoholic beverages.&#10;    *   *If No:* Skips this step.&#10;5.  **Room-Service Manager:** Assigns the order to a **Waiter**.&#10;6.  **Waiter:** Readies the cart (tablecloth, silverware, gathers non-alcoholic drinks).&#10;7.  **Kitchen:** Prepares the food, places it on the cart when ready.&#10;8.  **Sommelier:** (If applicable) Fetches wine/alcohol, prepares beverages, places them on the cart.&#10;9.  **Waiter:** *Order Preparation Complete:* Once food (Kitchen) and drinks (Waiter/Sommelier) are ready on the cart.&#10;10. **Waiter:** *Order Delivery:* Delivers the cart to the guest's room.&#10;11. **Waiter:** Returns to the room-service station.&#10;12. **Waiter:** *Decision Point: When to bill the guest?*&#10;    *   *Option 1 (Immediate):* Debits the guest's account immediately.&#10;    *   *Option 2 (Delayed):* Waits to do the billing if they have another order to prepare or deliver first. (Debits account later)." /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_2" sourceRef="atom_1_Task_7" targetRef="Bridge_2_d184" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_B2C_2" sourceRef="Bridge_2_d184" targetRef="atom_2_Task_13" /><bpmn:task id="atom_3_Task_1" name="Resolve complaint">
      <bpmn:incoming>atom_3_SequenceFlow_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>atom_3_SequenceFlow_3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
