      <bpmn:task id="Bridge_4_8daa" name="Here are two concise transition sentence options connecting Process A to Process B:&#10;&#10;**Option 1 (Direct):**&#10;&gt; Following a successfully resolved complaint where the customer expresses satisfaction in their feedback (Process A), the customer may proceed to register for new services, initiating the registration process (Process B).&#10;&#10;**Option 2 (Focus on Satisfaction):**&#10;&gt; A customer satisfied with the resolution and outcome of their complaint (Process A) can then choose to register for services, triggering the start of the registration process (Process B)." /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_4" sourceRef="atom_3_ExclusiveGateway_1" targetRef="Bridge_4_8daa" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_B2C_4" sourceRef="Bridge_4_8daa" targetRef="atom_4_sid-9F6C21B6-58B3-4033-9CB4-AB54861D6BA1" /><bpmn:task id="atom_5_Task_1" name="check case">
